  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "We have an unsorted array of integers.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 2460,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 74,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "For this lesson, our one input is 3, 4, minus 1, 1, 1, 10, 0, 2.",
      "start_ms": 3060,
      "end_ms": 11220,
      "start_frame": 92,
      "end_frame": 337,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "We need the smallest positive integer missing from it.",
      "start_ms": 12020,
      "end_ms": 15280,
      "start_frame": 361,
      "end_frame": 458,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Zero and negative values are not possible answers.",
      "start_ms": 15780,
      "end_ms": 19600,
      "start_frame": 473,
      "end_frame": 588,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "And the final solution must take linear time, with constant extra space.",
      "start_ms": 20160,
      "end_ms": 25480,
      "start_frame": 605,
      "end_frame": 764,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "First, what is the simplest correct way?",
      "start_ms": 26080,
      "end_ms": 28800,
      "start_frame": 782,
      "end_frame": 864,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Start with candidate 1.",
      "start_ms": 29680,
      "end_ms": 31380,
      "start_frame": 890,
      "end_frame": 941,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Search the array to see whether 1 is present.",
      "start_ms": 31720,
      "end_ms": 34040,
      "start_frame": 952,
      "end_frame": 1021,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "If it is there, try 2.",
      "start_ms": 34740,
      "end_ms": 36880,
      "start_frame": 1042,
      "end_frame": 1106,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Then 3.",
      "start_ms": 37260,
      "end_ms": 38040,
      "start_frame": 1118,
      "end_frame": 1141,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Always in increasing order.",
      "start_ms": 38500,
      "end_ms": 40660,
      "start_frame": 1155,
      "end_frame": 1220,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "The first candidate we cannot find must be the answer, because every smaller positive number was already found.",
      "start_ms": 41660,
      "end_ms": 49760,
      "start_frame": 1250,
      "end_frame": 1493,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's execute that method fully.",
      "start_ms": 50640,
      "end_ms": 52820,
      "start_frame": 1519,
      "end_frame": 1585,
      "word_count": 5
    }
  ],
